{"sha": "cf1a5fd53c8249192109b47e8b2064028c04312b66824e6f1895af547e76ecd9", "body": ["\\begin{example}[铁的边界]\\label{ex:b1:e-ph-diagrams:iron}", "取 $c = \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}$（常数取自\\cref{ch:b1:precipitation,ch:b1:nernst}）：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item \\ce{Fe^3+}/\\ce{Fe(OH)3}：$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 - \\frac13(38.55 - 2) = 1.82$；", "        \\ce{Fe^2+}/\\ce{Fe(OH)2}：$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 - \\frac12(16.31 - 2) = 6.85$。", "  \\item \\ce{Fe^2+}/\\ce{Fe}：$E = -0.41 + 0.030\\log c = -0.47$~V（pH 低于 6.85）。", "  \\item \\ce{Fe^3+}/\\ce{Fe^2+}：$E = 0.77$~V（两者浓度均为 $c$，pH 低于 1.82）。", "  \\item \\ce{Fe(OH)3}/\\ce{Fe^2+}：\\ce{Fe(OH)3 + 3H+ + e- -> Fe^2+ + 3H2O}，斜率", "        $-0.177$：$E = 1.09 - 0.177\\,\\mathrm{pH}$，适用于 pH 在 1.82 与 6.85 之间。", "  \\item \\ce{Fe(OH)3}/\\ce{Fe(OH)2}：一个电子、一个质子，$E = 0.28 -", "        0.059\\,\\mathrm{pH}$；\\ce{Fe(OH)2}/\\ce{Fe}：两个电子、两个", "        质子，$E = -0.07 - 0.059\\,\\mathrm{pH}$（pH 高于 6.85）。", "\\end{itemize}", "截距可由三相点处的连续性求得，也可直接由生成吉布斯自由能算出；", "下图由后一种方法算得，其边界与", "这些取整后的数值相差", "不超过 \\qty{0.01}{V} 或 0.01 个 pH 单位。", "% ledger: dfg:Fe2+_ao, dfg:Fe3+_ao, dfg:Fe_OH2_cr, dfg:Fe_OH3_cr, dfg:H2O_l, dfg:OH-_ao (boundaries computed in figdata/bachelor-1/eph-diagrams.py)", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=0.8\\linewidth, height=8.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=-1.2, ymax=1.6,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={pH}, ylabel={$E$ (V)},", "  xtick={0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14}, ytick={-1,-0.5,0,0.5,1,1.5},", "  unbounded coords=jump, clip=true,", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[black!45, dashed] table[x=pH, y=H2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-water.dat};", "\\addplot[black!45, dashed] table[x=pH, y=O2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-water.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, very thick] table[x=pH, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-iron.dat};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:3.2,-0.85) {\\ce{Fe}};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:3.4,0.15) {\\ce{Fe^2+}};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:0.9,1.45) {\\ce{Fe^3+}};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:8.5,0.25) {\\ce{Fe(OH)3}};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (axis cs:11.0,-0.56) {\\ce{Fe(OH)2}};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, black!55, rotate=-14, anchor=south] at (axis cs:12.0,0.52) {\\ce{O2}/\\ce{H2O}};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, black!55, rotate=-14, anchor=south] at (axis cs:2.2,-0.11) {\\ce{H2O}/\\ce{H2}};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 铁在 $c = \\qty{0.010}{mol/L}$ 时的电势–pH 图（实线），", "并标出水的两条线（虚线）。每条边界都", "由表中给出的生成吉布斯自由能算出。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{铜和锌}", "", "用同样的方法可得铜（物种 \\ce{Cu}、\\ce{Cu+}、", "\\ce{Cu2O}（$+$I）、\\ce{Cu^2+}、\\ce{CuO}（$+$II））和锌（\\ce{Zn}、", "\\ce{Zn^2+}、\\ce{Zn(OH)2}、\\ce{Zn(OH)4^2-}）的图。对于铜，\\ce{CuO}", "出现在 $\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 - \\frac12(20.64 - 2) = 4.68$ 处，而 \\ce{Cu+} 离子虽被列出，却完全没有区域：", "在酸性条件下，$E^\\circ(\\ce{Cu+}/\\ce{Cu}) = 0.52$~V 高于", "$E^\\circ(\\ce{Cu^2+}/\\ce{Cu+}) = 0.16$~V，因此其假想的区域被", "两侧的相邻物种划去（见\\cref{sec:b1:e-ph-diagrams:reading}）。", "对于锌，氢氧化物在 pH 6.81 处出现，", "而在本浓度下，仅当高于 13.97 时才以 \\ce{Zn(OH)4^2-} 的形式重新溶解，", "位于图的右边缘，是一条窄带。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[name=cu,", "  width=0.47\\linewidth, height=7cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=-1.4, ymax=1.6,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={pH}, ylabel={$E$ (V)},", "  xtick={0,4,8,12}, ytick={-1,-0.5,0,0.5,1,1.5},", "  unbounded coords=jump, clip=true,", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[black!45, dashed] table[x=pH, y=H2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-water.dat};", "\\addplot[black!45, dashed] table[x=pH, y=O2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-water.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, very thick] table[x=pH, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-copper.dat};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:5,-0.7) {\\ce{Cu}};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:2,0.7) {\\ce{Cu^2+}};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:9.5,0.75) {氧化铜 \\ce{CuO}};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize] (cuo) at (axis cs:11.8,-1.05) {\\ce{Cu2O}};", "\\draw[->, black!70] (cuo.north) -- (axis cs:10,-0.035);", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=north] at (axis cs:7,1.58) {铜};", "\\end{axis}", "\\begin{axis}[at={(cu.east)}, anchor=west, xshift=1.5cm,", "  width=0.47\\linewidth, height=7cm, xmin=0, xmax=14, ymin=-1.4, ymax=1.6,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={pH}, ylabel={$E$ (V)},", "  xtick={0,4,8,12}, ytick={-1,-0.5,0,0.5,1,1.5},", "  unbounded coords=jump, clip=true,", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[black!45, dashed] table[x=pH, y=H2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-water.dat};", "\\addplot[black!45, dashed] table[x=pH, y=O2] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-water.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, very thick] table[x=pH, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-eph-diagrams-zinc.dat};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:3.5,-1.15) {\\ce{Zn}};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:3.2,0.4) {\\ce{Zn^2+}};", "\\node[font=\\small] at (axis cs:10.2,0.4) {\\ce{Zn(OH)2}};", "\\draw[->] (axis cs:12.4,1.15) node[left, font=\\scriptsize] {\\ce{Zn(OH)4^2-}} -- (axis cs:13.95,1.15);", "\\node[font=\\small, anchor=north] at (axis cs:10.5,1.58) {锌};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 铜和锌的电势–pH 图（$c =", "\\qty{0.010}{mol/L}$），并标出水的两条线（虚线）。铜金属的", "区域与水的区域重叠；锌的区域", "则完全位于氢线之下。}", "% ledger: dfg:Cu+_ao, dfg:Cu2+_ao, dfg:Cu2O_cr, dfg:CuO_cr, dfg:Zn2+_ao, dfg:Zn_OH2_cr, dfg:Zn_OH42-_ao (boundaries computed in figdata/bachelor-1/eph-diagrams.py)", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{读图}\\label{sec:b1:e-ph-diagrams:reading}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[不相交区域]\\label{prop:b1:e-ph-diagrams:disjoint-domains}", "若在某一 pH 下，氧化剂的区域整体位于还原剂区域之上，", "且两者没有公共部分，则两者会发生反应；", "区域有公共部分的物种可以在平衡时共存。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "在该 pH 下，氧化剂电对在其边界之上具有", "高于还原剂电对所能达到的任何电势；", "由\\cref{prop:b1:nernst:equilibrium-constant}可知，两者间的反应有 $K > 1$，", "并持续进行，直到其中一方耗尽或两者区域相接。", "在公共区域内，两者在同一电势下都是稳定形式：", "没有任何东西驱动反应。", "\\end{proof}", ""]}